Interchange StudentIntervention
    documentation 'This interchange describes prescribed interventions available, implementations 
                  'of interventions, studies of intervention effectiveness, and education content 
                  'used in the course of interventions.
    element EducationContent
    element InterventionPrescription
    element Intervention
    element InterventionStudy
    element StudentInterventionAssociation
    element EducationOrganizationInterventionPrescriptionAssociation